<title>UK: Norgeskredit 350 million mark three-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Norgeskredit 350 million mark three-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers PaineWebber and Salomon Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORGESKREDIT</p>
<p> AMT    350 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 AUG.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +2.5 BP   PAY DATE    04.AUG.97</p>
<p> MOODY	A2	  ISS PRICE  100.023   FULL FEES   0.15</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   REOFFER    100.023</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/GB/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  NORWAY    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.075     SELL CONC  0.075     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863  </p>
<p> NOTES	NORGESKREDITT IS OWNED BY CHRISTIANIA BANK</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
